\f0\b Installation\
\

\f1\b0 Drag Trigonometry to your Applications folder.\
\
The first time you open it, macOS may block the application because it is not notarized by Apple. In that case, open System Settings > Privacy & Security, scroll down to the Security section and click \'93Open Anyway\'94.\
